---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: output
input_file: examples/peterson.txt
---
$ rsbdd -t -f true examples/peterson.txt
status: 10
--- stdout
| mutex | deadlock_free | recoverable | no_overtaking | *     |
|-------|---------------|-------------|---------------|-------|
| True  | True          | True        | True          | True  |
--- stderr

$ rsbdd -v examples/peterson.txt
status: 10
--- stdout
mutex, deadlock_free, recoverable, no_overtaking;
--- stderr

$ rsbdd -m -t -f true examples/peterson.txt
status: 10
--- stdout
| mutex | deadlock_free | recoverable | no_overtaking | *     |
|-------|---------------|-------------|---------------|-------|
| True  | True          | True        | True          | True  |
--- stderr
